# ============================================================
# PROJECT RULES – Landing Page: Fernando Quintero Astro Coaching
# ============================================================

## 🔮 Project Overview
We are building a **single-page landing website** for *Fernando Quintero*, coach especializado en **astrología cuántica kabbalista** y creador del método: *Reprogramación Cuántica del Destino* (3 sesiones).

The site must feel:
- Modern and elegant
- Mystical yet professional (NOT "woo woo")
- Clean with purposeful atmospheric elements
- High-end wellness/transformation (think luxury meditation app)
- Focused on selling the 3-session package
- Mobile-first and high-performance
- Smooth, subtle GSAP animations

**Key Balance:** Quantum physics meets ancient wisdom. Legitimate and transformative, not fortune teller aesthetic.

---

# ============================================================
# BRANDING GUIDELINES
# ============================================================

## 🎨 Colors (Brand Palette)
Primary colors (from logo):
- **Indigo Blue** – `#3a18b1`
- **Gray** – `#777777`

Neutrals:
- **Pure White** – `#ffffff`
- **Deep Space Background** – `#0A0A15` (for hero section)
- Optional extra neutral: **Soft Gray** – `#f4f4f4`

Accent colors:
- **Golden Accent** – `#F59E0B` (for "Reprogramación Cuántica del Destino")
- **Vibrant Purple/Indigo** – `#6366F1` (for CTA buttons)
- **Soft Purple** – `#8B5CF6` (for glows and accents)

Atmospheric effects (use sparingly):
- Subtle radial glows: `rgba(107, 70, 193, 0.2-0.4)` behind key elements
- Vignette edges: `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)` at 70-100% radius
- Geometric shapes: `rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15-0.3)`

**Critical Rule:** All mystical elements must be SUBTLE. Effects should be felt more than obviously seen.

---

## 🔤 Typography
Primary font family:
- **Cormorant Garamond** (Medium/SemiBold) for hero title and major headings
  - Elegant serif that conveys authority and spiritual depth
  - Use generous letter-spacing (1-2px)
  
- **Gadugi** (regular + bold) for navigation, body copy, and secondary headings
  - Clean, modern sans-serif for readability

Hierarchy:
- Hero title: Cormorant Garamond Medium/SemiBold, 72-76px desktop, large letter-spacing
- Section headings: Gadugi Bold
- Body copy: Gadugi Regular, line-height 1.7-1.8 for readability
- CTA buttons: Gadugi SemiBold

Rules:
- Use consistent font sizes from a scale defined in global SCSS
- Avoid unnecessary weights; keep it elegant and minimal
- Both fonts are Google Fonts (easy implementation)

---

# ============================================================
# TECH + ARCHITECTURE RULES
# ============================================================

## ⚙️ Framework & Languages
- **Next.js (latest)**
- **JavaScript only (NO TypeScript)**
- **GSAP** for animations
- **Custom SASS (SCSS)**
- NO Tailwind
- NO external UI libraries
- Mobile-first development approach

---

## 📁 Folder Structure Rules
Each component must live in its own folder:

```
/components
   /Header
      Header.jsx
      Header.scss
   /Hero
      Hero.jsx
      Hero.scss
   /Metodo
      Metodo.jsx
      Metodo.scss
   /Testimonials
      Testimonials.jsx
      Testimonials.scss
   /CTA
      CTA.jsx
      CTA.scss
```

Each `.scss` file must import the global settings file:

```scss
@import "../../styles/globals.scss";
```

Pages will live in `/app` (App Router).

---

## 🎨 Global Styles
Inside `/styles/globals.scss` define:

- Color variables
- Font declarations (@import from Google Fonts)
- Breakpoints
- Reset (minimal)
- Utility classes (only if strictly necessary)
- Typography scale (h1, h2, body, small)

Example:

```scss
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Gadugi:wght@400;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --color-indigo: #3a18b1;
  --color-gray: #777;
  --color-white: #fff;
  --color-space-bg: #0A0A15;
  --color-golden: #F59E0B;
  --color-purple: #6366F1;
  --color-purple-light: #8B5CF6;

  --font-primary: "Gadugi", sans-serif;
  --font-display: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
}

$break-mobile: 480px;
$break-tablet: 768px;
$break-desktop: 1180px;

body {
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--color-white);
  color: var(--color-gray);
}
```

---

# ============================================================
# DESIGN + UX RULES
# ============================================================

## 📱 Mobile First
- Base styles: mobile
- Use min-width media queries for tablet & desktop
- Layout must be clean and vertical
- Generous spacing
- No clutter

---

## ✨ Look & Feel
The site must communicate:
- Autoridad espiritual
- Profesionalismo moderno
- Claridad
- Profundidad sin exagerar lo "místico"

**Hero Section Specifics:**
- Dark cosmic background (#0A0A15) with animated stars
- Subtle rotating geometric shape (hexagon) at 15-20% opacity
- Soft radial glow behind text content (20-30% opacity)
- Vignette effect around edges to focus attention
- Large, commanding serif title (Cormoant Garamond)
- Clean, readable body copy with good line-height
- Prominent CTA with glow effect

**Rest of Site:**
- Light backgrounds (mostly white)
- Indigo accents
- Gray typography for balance
- Thin separators
- Subtle gradients (indigo → transparent)
- Soft glows only behind symbols or key words

Visual Balance:
- ❌ Avoid: New Age crystal shop with rainbow gradients everywhere
- ✅ Aim for: High-end meditation app or luxury wellness retreat
- ❌ Avoid: Fortune teller neon signs
- ✅ Aim for: Quantum physics meets ancient wisdom

Avoid:
- Heavy textures
- Overly "esoteric" icons
- Busy backgrounds
- Too many animations
- Anything that feels "woo woo" or illegitimate

---

## 🎥 Animations (GSAP)
Use GSAP for:
- Fade-in + upward motion on sections
- Smooth stagger on text reveals
- Slow rotating geometric shape in hero (left-right oscillation)
- Twinkling stars (opacity fade in/out)
- Subtle opacity background transitions
- Hover effects on CTA buttons (glow intensity)

Rules:
- Animations must be **tasteful**, **slow**, **clean**
- NO excessive bouncing or cartoon-like animations
- Use ScrollTrigger only when appropriate
- Hero animations should feel cosmic and elegant, never cheesy
- Keep durations slow (2-4 seconds for background elements)

---

# ============================================================
# CONTENT RULES
# ============================================================

## 📚 Core Sections for the Landing Page
1. **Hero**
   - Dark cosmic background with stars
   - Rotating geometric shape
   - Logo (top left)
   - Title: "Renace en tu Propósito" (Cormorant Garamond)
   - Subtitle with golden accent on "Reprogramación Cuántica del Destino"
   - Prominent CTA button: "Agenda tu proceso"

2. **Sobre Fernando**
   - Extract content from "método de reprogramación" document
   - Light background

3. **Método de Reprogramación Cuántica**
   - 3 sesiones
   - Icons minimalistas
   - Summary of each step

4. **Resultados / Beneficios**
   - Summary based on uploaded document

5. **Testimonios**
   - Placeholder until real content arrives

6. **CTA Final**
   - Strong headline
   - Button to agendar

---

# ============================================================
# COPYWRITING RULES
# ============================================================

Tone should be:
- Claro
- Inspirador
- Espiritual moderno
- Evitar cliché new-age
- Usar palabras como:
  - propósito
  - destino
  - reprogramación
  - conciencia
  - frecuencia
  - transformación
  - recordar quién eres
  - cuántico
  - alma
  - potencial máximo

Avoid:
- Terminología excesivamente técnica
- Exageraciones místicas sin fundamento
- Lenguaje que suene a "fortune teller"
- Promesas exageradas

---

# ============================================================
# CODING STYLE RULES
# ============================================================

## 🧼 General
- No semicolons
- Use ES modules
- Simple, clean React components
- Avoid unnecessary abstraction

## 🌿 SASS
- One component → one Sass file
- Reference global variables only
- Avoid deep nesting (>3 levels)
- DRY (reuse mixins/variables)

---

# ============================================================
# WHAT NOT TO DO
# ============================================================
- Do NOT use TypeScript
- Do NOT use Tailwind
- Do NOT install UI libraries
- Do NOT add random new brand colors
- Do NOT overcomplicate animations
- Do NOT introduce complex state management
- Do NOT write magic numbers → always use variables, spacing scale
- Do NOT make it look "woo woo" or illegitimate
- Do NOT add heavy textures or busy backgrounds
- Do NOT use aggressive or bouncy animations

---

# ============================================================
# ATMOSPHERIC ELEMENTS - USE SPARINGLY
# ============================================================
Mystical elements that ARE allowed (when used subtly):
- Slow rotating geometric shapes (low opacity)
- Twinkling stars (elegant, not flashy)
- Soft radial glows behind key content
- Vignette effects to focus attention
- Subtle gradient overlays
- Particle effects (if extremely subtle)

These should enhance the professional atmosphere, not distract from it.

---

# ============================================================
# READY TO BUILD
# ============================================================
Follow these rules for ALL future code generation, component creation, style decisions, and page structure for this project.

The goal is a landing page that feels like a premium transformation experience - legitimate, professional, and subtly mystical.